  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. Then which of the following statements are true?</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is a point of local minima of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is a point of inflection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;is increasing for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Only&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
